sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor X as 关闭发起者
    participant N as ProtocolNode
    participant RT as NodeRuntime
    participant T as ITransport
    participant BQ as BoundedQueue
    participant P as PendingTable
    participant F as finalizer fiber
    participant RL as 读循环 / handler fiber

    X->>N: Close()
    N->>RT: Close(signal_node_convergence)
    RT->>RT: Running → Closing（立即拒新 Request/Send）
    Note over RT,RL: 三方汇合信号（锁外）
    RT->>T: RequestClose()
    RT->>BQ: Close()（唤醒在途消费者）
    RT->>RT: handler_cancellation.Cancel()
    RT->>P: FailAll(kClosed, latch) 在途请求恰好一次收敛
    RT->>F: spawn finalizer fiber
    RT-->>X: closed_.Wait()（多等待者共享）

    F->>RL: loop_done_.Wait() 等读循环退出
    RL-->>F: 读循环收到 kClosed 退出
    F->>RL: handler_done_.Wait() 等 handler 退出<br/>（超 ~500ms 记 kInternal，不强杀）
    RL-->>F: handler 消费者退出
    F->>BQ: Drain() 未启动业务 → 逐条 close_drop 归因
    F->>RT: lifecycle = Closed + 记关闭时延
    F-->>X: closed_.Complete → 唤醒全部等待者
